## Translation Pipeline

```
article.title       → Groq llama-3.1-8b-instant (fastMode, shortText, NO embed rules)
article.description → Groq llama-3.1-8b-instant (fastMode, shortText, NO embed rules)
article.content     → Ollama gemini-3-flash-preview:cloud (primary)
                     → Groq llama-3.3-70b-versatile (fallback)
                     → Groq openai/gpt-oss-20b (fallback)
                     → Groq llama-3.1-8b-instant (last resort)
TL;DR enhancement   → Groq llama-3.1-8b-instant
```

### translateText() Signature
```js
translateText(text, useOllama = false, fastMode = false, shortText = false)
```
- title: `translateText(title, false, true, true)` — shortText uses dedicated headline prompt
- description: `translateText(desc, false, true, true)` — shortText uses dedicated headline prompt
- content: `translateText(content, true, false, false)` — full article rewrite prompt

### Widget Preservation
- Embed tokens `[[EMBED:TYPE:DATA]]` → replaced with `__WIDGET_N__` before LLM
- Restored after LLM with `restoreWidgets()`
- Hallucinated tokens stripped after restore

---

## Embed Token System
```
[[EMBED:YOUTUBE:VIDEO_ID]]      ← 11-char YouTube video ID
[[EMBED:TWEET:TWEET_ID]]        ← numeric tweet ID
[[EMBED:TIKTOK:FULL_URL]]       ← full TikTok URL without query params
```
Frontend React components render these tokens as embedded players.

