## Rules for AI Agents

1. **NEVER add scraping logic to news-scraper.js** — only orchestration
2. **NEVER duplicate functions** — check if method exists in parent/sibling class first
3. **NEVER use Firecrawl v1** — always v2 (`https://api.firecrawl.dev/v2/scrape`)
4. **NEVER add embed examples to prompts** — causes hallucination
5. **ALWAYS use OOP** — new scrapers extend BaseScraper, new features go in appropriate class
6. **ALWAYS check ScraperRouter** before touching FirecrawlScraper or CheerioScraper
7. **NEVER use `.catch()` on Supabase** — use try/catch
8. **Title/desc prompts must use shortText=true** — no embed rules in title/desc translation
9. **When adding content filters** — add to BOTH FirecrawlScraper._processScrapedContent() AND CheerioScraper._htmlToMarkdown()
10. **Before any edit** — grep for the function name to confirm it doesn't already exist elsewhere

